{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39245","headline":"江上逢故人 · 韦庄","name":"江上逢故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前年送我曲江西，红杏园中醉似泥。\n今日逢君越溪上，杜鹃花发鹧鸪啼。\n来时旧里人谁在，别後沧波路几迷。\n江畔玉楼多美酒，仲宣怀土莫凄凄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39245.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39245","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}